AI and the Future of Business
Topics
What is Artificial Intelligence?
Artificial Intelligence is the use of hardware of software based tools to create, answer questions, optimize, brainstorm, execute code, or other things to aide in processes

Brief history of AI
Not really touched on in detail in class, was theorized, then came deep learning, then generative and now many different models are in use by different organizations for assistance with tasks to outright completing them  
AI in everyday life
Often generative Ai used for answering questions, analysing, summarizing, speeds up workflow
AI versus automation
Automation is generally machines used for physical tasks like conveyor belts and picker arms, Ai is less physical and moreso computer based like analysis, coding, writing, generating
Narrow AI
Ai meant for a specific task
Generative AI
Ai that uses a databank to generate responses to queries
AI and the changing workplace
Ai is becoming more and more of a tool in the workplace and over time is starting to become a necessity rather than an option
Opportunities and limitations of AI
Ai can be used in many ways and over time the number of things it can do are expanding with new models, more data and the limitations are really just what we haven't thought of, we can create new models
and ask them/ figure out how to have them do new tasks to ease work or assist in completion
